# Release artifacts (GoReleaser output).
/dist/

# Compiled binaries built ad-hoc at the repo root (`go build ./cmd/<name>`). The tracked build path
# is GoReleaser's /dist; these root binaries are never checked in.
#
# A pattern rather than a list of names: the list drifted to 6 entries for 13 commands, so every
# service added after it was written — content-key-svc among them — was one `git add -A` away from
# being committed. /*-svc covers every service by construction, including the next one; only the
# tools that do not follow the naming convention are named. Root-anchored, so cmd/ is untouched.
/*-svc
/migrate
/fake-smsc
/mt-replay
/config-sync

# Contracts package: the .d.ts are generated at publish time from the YAML, never checked in —
# a committed copy would be one more thing that can drift from its source.
/api/dist/
/api/node_modules/

# Go build & test artifacts.
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# Local environment overrides.
.env
.env.*

# OS / editor cruft.
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
